      "text": "【“一”】"
    },
    {
      "frame": 29,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "frame": 30,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "……\n……"
    },
    {
      "frame": 31,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "……\n……\n……"
    },
    {
      "frame": 32,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "【与丹同宿一屋的小七在半夜里失踪了。】"
    },
    {
      "frame": 33,
      "speaker": "丹",
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "frame": 34,
      "speaker": "丹",
      "text": "怎……怎么会……"
    },
    {
      "frame": 35,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "【倪丹，女，G市当红歌星。】"
    },
    {
      "frame": 36,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "【深夜，借宿于魔方旅馆的她，被一场噩梦惊醒。】"
    },
    {
      "frame": 37,
      "speaker": "丹",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "frame": 38,
      "speaker": "丹",
      "text": "这是怎么回事……而且……我怎么会穿成这样睡觉……"
    },
    {
      "frame": 39,
